# KiCad colour and layer data

PCB default colour values and layer ordering data are derived from KiCad 10,
KiCad contributors, source revision 3e051f88. No KiCad implementation source is included.

Data references: common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h,
pcbnew/widgets/appearance_controls.cpp, and pcbnew/pcb_draw_panel_gal.cpp.

Schematic default colour values are data from KiCad 10, commit 3e051f88,
common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h:31–81, Copyright KiCad Contributors.
https://gitlab.com/kicad/code/kicad
No KiCad GPL implementation source is included. Several schematic roles
share an identical exported colour; the SVG exact-value palette maps them
together. Drawing-sheet paths and title text are generated by kicad-cli.

# KiCad colour data (UI tokens)

The PCB background #001023 and schematic paper #F5F4EF used by ui/tokens.css
are numeric default-colour data from KiCad 10.0, source commit 3e051f88:
common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h:160 (PCB background, RGB 0,16,35)
common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h:32 (schematic background, RGB 245,244,239).
https://gitlab.com/kicad/code/kicad/-/blob/3e051f88/common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h
Credit: The KiCad Developers; colour settings copyright Jon Evans (2020).
Only numeric colour data is reused; no KiCad GPL implementation source is copied.

# KiCad icons

Six toolbar icon variants and their derived inline SVG symbols are reused under
CC-BY-SA-4.0. Authors, source, modifications and complete license: ui/icons/LICENSE.
Only this artwork is share-alike; application code and the repository's existing
licensing are unchanged. The theme-control disc icon is original project artwork.

KiCad colour values, theme key names and layer mappings are data derived from
KiCad 10.0 (commit 3e051f88), common/settings/builtin_color_themes.h and
color_settings.cpp, KiCad Contributors, https://www.kicad.org/.
No KiCad program source is included.
